            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A reinforcement structure comprising an inner member at least partially secured within a shell, wherein the inner member is secured within the shell so that one or more abutment portions of the shell or inner member are positioned in receiving portions of the inner member or shell, respectively, to create at least a partial press-fit condition between the inner member and the shell.</p>
